{"about_the_game":"Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side effects</h2>The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character.<br>These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels.<br>By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay5.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Head-scratching puzzles</h2>Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay4.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse levels</h2>The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award-winning</h2>Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995150?t=1744362565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995150?t=1744362565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/1d1f44fa9c626d848913750b5b7f7e7dd23cfe7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744362565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/1d1f44fa9c626d848913750b5b7f7e7dd23cfe7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744362565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3413380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Side effects</h2>The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character.<br>These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels.<br>By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay5.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Head-scratching puzzles</h2>Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay4.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse levels</h2>The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/gameplay3.gif?t=1744362565\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award-winning</h2>Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.","developers":["Daivy","Kuviman","Vesdev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/header.jpg?t=174436256